(5868155, 854164, 29009, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice effort, but a couple of randomly placed straw hats next to an electrical box is not enough to suggest surrealism.  Better luck next time!</td>', 'It''s a nice effort, but a couple of randomly placed straw hats next to an electrical box is not enough to suggest surrealism.  Better luck next time!', '2010-02-15 15:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5868158, 853997, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think you over processed this..especially the eyes.  One eye is looks completely blood shot.  The blue of the eyes look entirely too fake. Her right eye looks as if you colored the pupil blue as well.    The lighting and her skin look great (although it too looks a little too smooth. Almost doll like.) and if not over processes this would have been a great shot.</td>', 'I think you over processed this..especially the eyes.  One eye is looks completely blood shot.  The blue of the eyes look entirely too fake. Her right eye looks as if you colored the pupil blue as well.    The lighting and her skin look great (although it too looks a little too smooth. Almost doll like.) and if not over processes this would have been a great shot.', '2010-02-15 15:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
