(5870025, 854164, 18367, '<td valign="top">Shall I work on the premise that these hats once belonged to the poor unfortunate souls that got zapped by the transformer.  I really don''t know if you did this intentionally, but the juxtaposition of these items did make me laugh out loud.</td>', 'Shall I work on the premise that these hats once belonged to the poor unfortunate souls that got zapped by the transformer.  I really don''t know if you did this intentionally, but the juxtaposition of these items did make me laugh out loud.', '2010-02-16 22:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870031, 854168, 18367, '<td valign="top">The head wear in this image is barely visible and I fear your score might suffer for it.  Overall not a bad image, but one''s eyes are drawn primarily to the weapon and not the hood.  Good luck.</td>', 'The head wear in this image is barely visible and I fear your score might suffer for it.  Overall not a bad image, but one''s eyes are drawn primarily to the weapon and not the hood.  Good luck.', '2010-02-16 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
