(5870569, 853890, 112861, '<td valign="top">Wow! The red piping on the hat looks like it could cut, it''s so sharp. (In a good way) Seems like there''s a deep story to this one, somehow.<br/> <br/>I like it. (like one of my faves in this challenge)<br/> <br/>Cbaceba za foto.<br/> <br/>B-}</td>', 'Wow! The red piping on the hat looks like it could cut, it''s so sharp. (In a good way) Seems like there''s a deep story to this one, somehow. I like it. (like one of my faves in this challenge) Cbaceba za foto. B-}', '2010-02-17 03:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870571, 854147, 112861, '<td valign="top">Another black on black pulled off nicely. Maybe just a tad more definition on the top of the helmet. Nice, just the same.</td>', 'Another black on black pulled off nicely. Maybe just a tad more definition on the top of the helmet. Nice, just the same.', '2010-02-17 03:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870573, 853595, 112861, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a similar picture by a stream???<br/> <br/>It''s a good one. I especially like the fade-in from the front to the high key background.</td>', 'This reminds me of a similar picture by a stream??? It''s a good one. I especially like the fade-in from the front to the high key background.', '2010-02-17 03:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870574, 853942, 112861, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2010-02-17 03:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870575, 854105, 112861, '<td valign="top">What this is lacking in technique, (which isn''t much) is made up for by the capture of emotion. The "eyes" have it. I think this may do quite well IMHO. Something about it...</td>', 'What this is lacking in technique, (which isn''t much) is made up for by the capture of emotion. The "eyes" have it. I think this may do quite well IMHO. Something about it...', '2010-02-17 03:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870579, 853436, 112861, '<td valign="top">Almost seems like too many textures and tones for my comfort zone. Not a bad score, but something here causes uneasiness with me.</td>', 'Almost seems like too many textures and tones for my comfort zone. Not a bad score, but something here causes uneasiness with me.', '2010-02-17 03:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870589, 854019, 112861, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I feel like you had plenty of texture going for you in this picture (and it would have scored higher on my vote) without the "baking". Everything else about the exposure, I like. Sorta seems like you''re making the salt the main course, instead of the seasoning. (Still voted above average)</td>', 'Hmmm. I feel like you had plenty of texture going for you in this picture (and it would have scored higher on my vote) without the "baking". Everything else about the exposure, I like. Sorta seems like you''re making the salt the main course, instead of the seasoning. (Still voted above average)', '2010-02-17 03:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870594, 853896, 112861, '<td valign="top">Striking image, especially in those John Lennon specs. To be nit-picky, I wish the tint was more toward sepia or grayscale. Otherwise, I like it.</td>', 'Striking image, especially in those John Lennon specs. To be nit-picky, I wish the tint was more toward sepia or grayscale. Otherwise, I like it.', '2010-02-17 03:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
