(5870652, 853573, 35560, '<td valign="top">This is just too darn cute not to comment on, being a fellow mini schnauzer owner.  I''m an amateur photographer, so I''ll leave the technical criticism to the pros.  I think this is a clever and interesting interpretation of the challenge, and I love that it''s in black and white and grey, to match your puppy.</td>', 'This is just too darn cute not to comment on, being a fellow mini schnauzer owner.  I''m an amateur photographer, so I''ll leave the technical criticism to the pros.  I think this is a clever and interesting interpretation of the challenge, and I love that it''s in black and white and grey, to match your puppy.', '2010-02-17 04:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870654, 853997, 35560, '<td valign="top">Mostly beautiful.  Love the detail in the towel and softer focus on model. Not particularly fond of the way the shadows on her neck have been airbrushed.  They look like sooty marks to me.  Same for overprocessing? on LHS of her face.<br/>I like the composition though.</td>', 'Mostly beautiful.  Love the detail in the towel and softer focus on model. Not particularly fond of the way the shadows on her neck have been airbrushed.  They look like sooty marks to me.  Same for overprocessing? on LHS of her face.I like the composition though.', '2010-02-17 04:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
