(5871041, 854144, 83313, '<td valign="top">A unique approach that may not be DPC friendly, but is clearly an intentional look. I like it, but I will also be interested in seeing how this one sorts out. I suspect it will be divided between the lovers and haters.</td>', 'A unique approach that may not be DPC friendly, but is clearly an intentional look. I like it, but I will also be interested in seeing how this one sorts out. I suspect it will be divided between the lovers and haters.', '2010-02-17 12:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871042, 853678, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nothing in the image seems sharp and clear I''m afraid, and the composition comes off to me a bit awkward as well. Perhaps cropping just under her nose could have worked better. Not sure...</td>', 'Nothing in the image seems sharp and clear I''m afraid, and the composition comes off to me a bit awkward as well. Perhaps cropping just under her nose could have worked better. Not sure...', '2010-02-17 12:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871047, 854166, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love this one! The flower in front of the face is the perfect quirky touch. Something like this could make a good album cover.</td>', 'I love this one! The flower in front of the face is the perfect quirky touch. Something like this could make a good album cover.', '2010-02-17 12:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871054, 853296, 83313, '<td valign="top">A really well done photo, but one thing bothers me about it a lot. Her headwear is natural leaves, but her face is covered in heavy makeup. It seems contradictory. Perhaps a contradictory image was your intention, but it''s not carrying across to me that way.I personally would have found a lighter hand on the makeup to suit the idea better. Still well done, and worth a vote on the positive side.</td>', 'A really well done photo, but one thing bothers me about it a lot. Her headwear is natural leaves, but her face is covered in heavy makeup. It seems contradictory. Perhaps a contradictory image was your intention, but it''s not carrying across to me that way.I personally would have found a lighter hand on the makeup to suit the idea better. Still well done, and worth a vote on the positive side.', '2010-02-17 12:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871058, 854019, 83313, '<td valign="top"><b>Real</b> men tonemap the crap out of their photos and they don''t apologize for it.</td>', 'Real men tonemap the crap out of their photos and they don''t apologize for it.', '2010-02-17 13:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871062, 853821, 83313, '<td valign="top">You look like you need some levels, contrast and saturation adjustments. That would make you smile, I think. A nice helping of Topaz adjust would also help you to grow big and strong, so you can carry all of your parent''s camera gear when they go hiking. <br/> <br/>Extra pointage for giving me an opportunity to leave one of my idiotic comments.</td>', 'You look like you need some levels, contrast and saturation adjustments. That would make you smile, I think. A nice helping of Topaz adjust would also help you to grow big and strong, so you can carry all of your parent''s camera gear when they go hiking.  Extra pointage for giving me an opportunity to leave one of my idiotic comments.', '2010-02-17 13:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871064, 854102, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the soft romatic look with the strong red lips and hat.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the soft romatic look with the strong red lips and hat.', '2010-02-17 13:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871068, 854167, 83313, '<td valign="top">I had considered entering a shot of someone in a mask from Mardi Gras. It was oneof my best from the event, but I felt too many voters would say that a mask was not headgear. I''ll be interested in seeing where this one comes in and what the other comments say.</td>', 'I had considered entering a shot of someone in a mask from Mardi Gras. It was oneof my best from the event, but I felt too many voters would say that a mask was not headgear. I''ll be interested in seeing where this one comes in and what the other comments say.', '2010-02-17 13:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
