(5874750, 852981, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does look a bit like a wizard with a white beard. Though in reality it''s probably a tree root. Kind of cool how you found that in such a blur.</td>', 'Does look a bit like a wizard with a white beard. Though in reality it''s probably a tree root. Kind of cool how you found that in such a blur.', '2010-02-21 01:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5874755, 854009, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool that you were able to attend this. I''ll bet it''s a blast watching in person. The photo comes across as a heavily cropped snapshot, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Pretty cool that you were able to attend this. I''ll bet it''s a blast watching in person. The photo comes across as a heavily cropped snapshot, I''m afraid.', '2010-02-21 01:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5874763, 854113, 114409, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this picture, just great !</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this picture, just great !', '2010-02-21 01:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875068, 853296, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very Autumnal feel to this - nice work though !</td>', 'Very Autumnal feel to this - nice work though !', '2010-02-21 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875069, 853961, 68586, '<td valign="top">So is this Will or Chris . . ?<br/> <br/> :- )</td>', 'So is this Will or Chris . . ?  :- )', '2010-02-21 12:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875071, 853941, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nicely captures the headware aspect - but we sort of lose contact with the model inside - perhaps if you had just brightened her face a little more - or brought her eye detail out it would have just had a little more punch ?</td>', 'Nicely captures the headware aspect - but we sort of lose contact with the model inside - perhaps if you had just brightened her face a little more - or brought her eye detail out it would have just had a little more punch ?', '2010-02-21 12:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875072, 853890, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great hat and nice work tying in all the elements - it might just come over more as a Russian theme than specifically the headware though . .</td>', 'Great hat and nice work tying in all the elements - it might just come over more as a Russian theme than specifically the headware though . .', '2010-02-21 12:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875074, 853458, 68586, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the pacifier is more prominent than any ''headware'' . . and pacifiers (understandably) never do well in challenges.<br/> <br/>Cute kid though  :- )</td>', 'Unfortunately the pacifier is more prominent than any ''headware'' . . and pacifiers (understandably) never do well in challenges. Cute kid though  :- )', '2010-02-21 12:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875077, 853952, 68586, '<td valign="top">Pretty model and interesting eye make-up but the picture doesn''t really seem to engage or send a clear message . .<br/> <br/>Are we looking at the interesting and unusual hat ?<br/>or the interesting and unusual eye make up ?<br/>The eye catching blue blouse that provides the only strong colour in the picture ?<br/>Or the fact that the blouse seems to carry on being open out the bottom of the picture . . which many would find interesting :- ) ?<br/> <br/>Lots of different elements and many of them really quite good - but no single focal point to focus on.<br/> <br/>Perhaps a square crop and a background of either white or black would lift this and focus the viewers attention more ?<br/> <br/>Good luck though.</td>', 'Pretty model and interesting eye make-up but the picture doesn''t really seem to engage or send a clear message . . Are we looking at the interesting and unusual hat ?or the interesting and unusual eye make up ?The eye catching blue blouse that provides the only strong colour in the picture ?Or the fact that the blouse seems to carry on being open out the bottom of the picture . . which many would find interesting :- ) ? Lots of different elements and many of them really quite good - but no single focal point to focus on. Perhaps a square crop and a background of either white or black would lift this and focus the viewers attention more ? Good luck though.', '2010-02-21 13:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875078, 854017, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice gritty feel to this.</td>', 'nice gritty feel to this.', '2010-02-21 13:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875079, 854136, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and outfit - I''m not completely sure about the brick wall - but still a nice picture.</td>', 'Great lighting and outfit - I''m not completely sure about the brick wall - but still a nice picture.', '2010-02-21 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875082, 854014, 68586, '<td valign="top">Certainly a different take on the challenge and one that I''m sure will have a lot more views than votes  :- )<br/> <br/>For me this is really two seperate pictures in one. On the plus side the hat is crisp clean and focussed which is positive - but the other section of the picture is photographically not so strong. The B&amp;W conversion has left slightly muddy skin tones and the model doesn''t quite seem to be in focus. As she is a major element of the picture, this is clearly a distraction - and perhaps not in the way you intended  :- )</td>', 'Certainly a different take on the challenge and one that I''m sure will have a lot more views than votes  :- ) For me this is really two seperate pictures in one. On the plus side the hat is crisp clean and focussed which is positive - but the other section of the picture is photographically not so strong. The B&W conversion has left slightly muddy skin tones and the model doesn''t quite seem to be in focus. As she is a major element of the picture, this is clearly a distraction - and perhaps not in the way you intended  :- )', '2010-02-21 13:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875083, 854105, 68586, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot  :- )</td>', 'Sweet shot  :- )', '2010-02-21 13:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
