(5875264, 854018, 61961, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, as usual.  Amazing art direction in this one (the hat, makeup, coat, etc. all compliment the model''s coloring).  I''d say the only drawback (from a viewer''s point of view) is a bit of over-familiarity with your beautiful model.  On the other hand, many famous photographers have had their muse. :-D</td>', 'Gorgeous, as usual.  Amazing art direction in this one (the hat, makeup, coat, etc. all compliment the model''s coloring).  I''d say the only drawback (from a viewer''s point of view) is a bit of over-familiarity with your beautiful model.  On the other hand, many famous photographers have had their muse. :-D', '2010-02-21 17:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5875266, 853728, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice casual outdoor portrait and fits the theme of course.  I''m curious if you used a fill-flash or other bounce light -- the exposure seems perfect.  Sharp but not over-sharpened.  Great smile and eyes on the model.  Love the textures (especially in the hat) and the nearly all-white background, which is just varied enough to convey snow.  And now I know what a Ushanka is!</td>', 'Nice casual outdoor portrait and fits the theme of course.  I''m curious if you used a fill-flash or other bounce light -- the exposure seems perfect.  Sharp but not over-sharpened.  Great smile and eyes on the model.  Love the textures (especially in the hat) and the nearly all-white background, which is just varied enough to convey snow.  And now I know what a Ushanka is!', '2010-02-21 17:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
