(5875923, 854136, 28742, '<td valign="top">I say "Bah!" at your notes. I love your smile and you have as much model quality as most anything I''ve seen. Sure, I don''t get out much, but still. :-) Great job on both sides of the camera!</td>', 'I say "Bah!" at your notes. I love your smile and you have as much model quality as most anything I''ve seen. Sure, I don''t get out much, but still. :-) Great job on both sides of the camera!', '2010-02-22 01:33:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5875932, 854017, 28742, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked it better had you shot it off the reflection of your bathroom sink drain lever. :P Great job on this, Lydia. Really if I had to guess why this didn''t do better, I might say something about the background or overall contrast - it all just seems to blend together. The good news is that this could easily be edited into complete awesomeness any number of ways. :-) Cheers.</td>', 'I would''ve liked it better had you shot it off the reflection of your bathroom sink drain lever. :P Great job on this, Lydia. Really if I had to guess why this didn''t do better, I might say something about the background or overall contrast - it all just seems to blend together. The good news is that this could easily be edited into complete awesomeness any number of ways. :-) Cheers.', '2010-02-22 01:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5875954, 854018, 61084, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Fabulous (if oversaturated) color.  Her lips are glowing, and not in a good way.  But the eyes are incredible. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Tanguera, have you never heard of lipstick? At least that''s what it looks like to me.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Fabulous (if oversaturated) color.  Her lips are glowing, and not in a good way.  But the eyes are incredible.   Tanguera, have you never heard of lipstick? At least that''s what it looks like to me.', '2010-02-22 01:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
