(5876131, 852928, 47249, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 10 and I hoped to see a ribbon for this one, it''s fantastic! Congratulations on your top 10!</td>', 'I gave it a 10 and I hoped to see a ribbon for this one, it''s fantastic! Congratulations on your top 10!', '2010-02-22 03:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876134, 854122, 99506, '<td valign="top">Come on Erik tell us a bit about your shot</td>', 'Come on Erik tell us a bit about your shot', '2010-02-22 03:30:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876136, 854078, 47249, '<td valign="top">I think it deserved at least a top ten finish, anyway congratulations on your top 20! It was a 9 from me.</td>', 'I think it deserved at least a top ten finish, anyway congratulations on your top 20! It was a 9 from me.', '2010-02-22 03:33:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876138, 853573, 47249, '<td valign="top">I appreciated this one a lot and I think it deserved a ribbon. Congratulations anyway, I gave it a 10!</td>', 'I appreciated this one a lot and I think it deserved a ribbon. Congratulations anyway, I gave it a 10!', '2010-02-22 03:36:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876153, 853942, 92577, '<td valign="top">I''d have placed this comfortably in the top ten but at the end of the day it all comes down to personal taste. Some of those placed above yours display a more subtle handling of tonal balance. In yours, the models face is light, bright and smooth while elsewhere in the same image there are slightly overpowering, rich, contrasty textures in the sleeve and bangles.<br/>I hope you don''t mind me thinking out loud here - I''m trying to learn something myself through this analysis.</td>', 'I''d have placed this comfortably in the top ten but at the end of the day it all comes down to personal taste. Some of those placed above yours display a more subtle handling of tonal balance. In yours, the models face is light, bright and smooth while elsewhere in the same image there are slightly overpowering, rich, contrasty textures in the sleeve and bangles.I hope you don''t mind me thinking out loud here - I''m trying to learn something myself through this analysis.', '2010-02-22 03:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876164, 853992, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey steve .. wot a blast to see you with the blue for this incredible shot ... <br/>HUGE CONGRATULATIONS ..  looks mighty fine on your profile page with all the other birds .. !!..:) ..:)<br/></td>', 'hey steve .. wot a blast to see you with the blue for this incredible shot ... HUGE CONGRATULATIONS ..  looks mighty fine on your profile page with all the other birds .. !!..:) ..:)', '2010-02-22 04:24:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876170, 854077, 99506, '<td valign="top">Sorry Leanna I thought this was <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=73452" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">photokariangel</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-22 04:38:21.</i></td>', 'Sorry Leanna I thought this was  photokariangel', '2010-02-22 04:37:53.000000', '2010-02-22 04:38:21.000000', 0),
(5876172, 853981, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely fantastic .. magritte and escher are a couple of my favourite artists .. just for their weirdness .. <br/>i love how you''ve captured the magritte feel so well .. congrats on a great place in the challenge .. :)</td>', 'this is absolutely fantastic .. magritte and escher are a couple of my favourite artists .. just for their weirdness .. i love how you''ve captured the magritte feel so well .. congrats on a great place in the challenge .. :)', '2010-02-22 04:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876182, 853888, 64670, '<td valign="top">This is stunning - SO wonderful, can''t believe it didn''t win.</td>', 'This is stunning - SO wonderful, can''t believe it didn''t win.', '2010-02-22 05:00:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876184, 853942, 99411, '<td valign="top">Hi David<br/> <br/>Thanks for taking the time to think out loud.  Did you guess it was me or did you have this pegged for Lutchenko. or someone else?<br/> <br/>I am not sure it deserved to place any higher given the other shots although it clearly should have beaten Lutchenko''s entry of the same model!!!!<br/> <br/>For me it''s the stark white background that doesn''t help.  The model is an up and coming singer.  She was very specific about wanting a blown out white background, personal I would have tried to soften the image a bit with something more neutral.  Lutchenko avoided this by doing a tighter crop, but thats cheating!</td>', 'Hi David Thanks for taking the time to think out loud.  Did you guess it was me or did you have this pegged for Lutchenko. or someone else? I am not sure it deserved to place any higher given the other shots although it clearly should have beaten Lutchenko''s entry of the same model!!!! For me it''s the stark white background that doesn''t help.  The model is an up and coming singer.  She was very specific about wanting a blown out white background, personal I would have tried to soften the image a bit with something more neutral.  Lutchenko avoided this by doing a tighter crop, but thats cheating!', '2010-02-22 05:03:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876185, 853961, 99411, '<td valign="top">Arrrrrghhhhh.  Well it was your birthday</td>', 'Arrrrrghhhhh.  Well it was your birthday', '2010-02-22 05:06:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5876193, 853992, 69368, '<td valign="top">WOW! Really fantastic portrait!<br/>Congrats on the well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'WOW! Really fantastic portrait!Congrats on the well deserved ribbon!', '2010-02-22 05:40:38.000000', NULL, 0),
