(5876199, 854122, 82749, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lutchenko:</b></div><hr/><i> Come on Erik tell us a bit about your shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank-you to Khani for a great job as well as to Blackwatch Studios for providing the hat.  Natural light from the window + reflector.  (I wasn''t sure if cloning out the window frame would be too big of a change so I left it in to be on the safe side.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-22 06:10:33.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Lutchenko: Come on Erik tell us a bit about your shot  Thank-you to Khani for a great job as well as to Blackwatch Studios for providing the hat.  Natural light from the window + reflector.  (I wasn''t sure if cloning out the window frame would be too big of a change so I left it in to be on the safe side.)', '2010-02-22 06:09:49.000000', '2010-02-22 06:10:33.000000', 0),
