(5877491, 853992, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a most stunning portrait. The skin, the eyes, the color, everything''s perfect.<br/>I''ve been trying to work out why the hand''s bothering me... The finger pointing upwards seems not to belong to the rest of the hand, as if it''s pointing the wrong way... (Please excuse my garbling on, maybe Zargonians have hands that makes us earthlings wonder... ;-)) Huge congrats on your well deserved win.</td>', 'This is a most stunning portrait. The skin, the eyes, the color, everything''s perfect.I''ve been trying to work out why the hand''s bothering me... The finger pointing upwards seems not to belong to the rest of the hand, as if it''s pointing the wrong way... (Please excuse my garbling on, maybe Zargonians have hands that makes us earthlings wonder... ;-)) Huge congrats on your well deserved win.', '2010-02-23 03:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5877496, 854147, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hrm, 5.78? I think this photo was underscored. I really liked the abstraction of a mundane object, and this photo showed good control of tonality. I thought it was really good that you got the full range of tones. Points of criticism would be the border (I would have liked an equal amount of room on the sides as the top, and I think the white was too bright) and the loss of detail in the darker areas of the helmet, but the care and skill you demonstrated with the rest of the photo should, I think, have been enough for a significantly higher score.</td>', 'Hrm, 5.78? I think this photo was underscored. I really liked the abstraction of a mundane object, and this photo showed good control of tonality. I thought it was really good that you got the full range of tones. Points of criticism would be the border (I would have liked an equal amount of room on the sides as the top, and I think the white was too bright) and the loss of detail in the darker areas of the helmet, but the care and skill you demonstrated with the rest of the photo should, I think, have been enough for a significantly higher score.', '2010-02-23 04:06:26.000000', NULL, 0),
