(5888891, 853573, 113634, '<td valign="top">just read your post(about the AFV)on the forums, so i wanted to look at your other work...and had to tell you that this was my favorite pic in the headwear challenge.... i was really surprised that it wasn''t on of the top 3.   my dog is the same when you put anything on him (clothes, hats, etc....) will stand perfectly still and not move until you take it off.  poor puppies, but they do make for amazing pictures that capture so much emotion.  great pic!!</td>', 'just read your post(about the AFV)on the forums, so i wanted to look at your other work...and had to tell you that this was my favorite pic in the headwear challenge.... i was really surprised that it wasn''t on of the top 3.   my dog is the same when you put anything on him (clothes, hats, etc....) will stand perfectly still and not move until you take it off.  poor puppies, but they do make for amazing pictures that capture so much emotion.  great pic!!', '2010-03-03 14:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
